    <div class="border border-[#2A2A2F] bg-[#131316] p-6 font-mono-tech">
      <div class="text-[#FF0033] text-sm tracking-widest">★★★★★</div>
      <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-[#F5F5F7] leading-relaxed">
        "Quality is insane for the price. The weight of the 316L chain feels authentic and solid."
      </p>
      <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-[#2A2A2F] text-[10px] uppercase text-[#A3A7AE]">
